'''Frosty the Snow Cannon''' is a {{Rare}} item that can fire {{Item|Snowball}}s for the [[Season of Jerry]] event. It can be obtained once from {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} for free.

== Obtaining ==
'''Frosty the Snow Cannon''' can be obtained by talking to {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. More can be purchased for {{c|1000}} by interacting with {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} without the original item in the player's inventory, or by using the command {{Code|/opencannonbuymenu}}. It is initially completely filled with {{Item|Snowball|amount=1000}}s.

== Usage ==
The player can click or hold down right-click to shoot {{Item|Snowball}}s.

'''Frosty the Snow Cannon''' has a capacity of {{Item|Snowball|amount=1000}}s. The ammo count is shown in the description and can be shown by left clicking while holding '''Frosty the Snow Cannon'''. The player can refill their ammo by interacting with {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} for {{c|1}} per {{Item|Snowball}} missing. If the player does not meet the {{c}} requirement, {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} will refill '''Frosty the Cannon''' based on the amount of {{c}} the player has.

If the player wears {{Item|Snow Suit Armor|text=Snow Suit}} or {{Item|Nutcracker Armor}}, '''Frosty the Snow Cannon''' gains infinite ammo.

A {{Mythic}} {{Item|Snowman Pet}} has a {{Green|50%}} chance to double damage done by {{Item|Snowball}}s.

== Trivia ==
* Trying to place '''Frosty the Snow Cannon''' to put out a fire, successfully places the item. Breaking it returns it while removing all {{Item|Snowball}}s.{{confirm}}

